# Unreal generated folders (rebuilt automatically)
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
.vs/

# Generated Visual Studio files
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# Backups and logs (git replaces these)
*.bak
*.bak?
build_log.txt
Packaged/
Build/
*.blend1

# The 2.4 million triangle test house: too big for GitHub's file limit. Remake it from its Meshy task (Docs/Roadmap.md) if needed.
Art/Buildings/*Detailed*
Content/Buildings/*Detailed*

# All library originals (filler props and animals): several GB in total. Art/Filler/Sources.md and Art/Animals/Sources.md link every page to download them again.
Art/Filler/Originals/
Art/Animals/Originals/

# Filler lineup assets (Tools/BuildFillerLineup.ps1 remakes them from Art/Filler/Clean; about 700 MB)
Content/Filler/

# The plaza oak as Meshy made it (156 MB; Tools/plaza_oak_clean.py makes Art/Trees/PlazaOak.glb from it; the link is in Docs/MeshyCommunityLibrary.md)
Art/Trees/*_Original*

# Python bytecode caches from the tool scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# TownLab: downloaded CC0 texture originals (Docs/TownLab/Sources.md)
Art/TownLab/Textures/Sources/

# Project Nature grass packs from the owner's Fab library (about 1.5 GB; Docs/TownLab/AssetScout.md "Grass packs"): add them again with the launcher's Add to project
Content/PN_GrassLibrary/
Content/PN_MeadowFlowers/
Content/PN_OpenWorldFoliage/
Content/PN_interactiveSpruceForest/
Content/DZ_Assets/
Content/Megaplant_Library/
# the Spruce Forest pack's colour textures with the cones repainted (2026-11-21): made on each machine by Tools/BuildSpruceCones.ps1
Content/TreeGroves/SpruceCones/

# Meshy library originals of the shields and world props (2026-11-16; links in Art/Props/Sources.md, Art/WorldProps/Sources.md)
Art/Props/Originals/
Art/WorldProps/Originals/
Art/Bridge/*Detailed*
